    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introducing Tamer: King of Dinosaurs An adventure game for people of culture who love dinosaurs, adventure, and beautiful alien women.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compelling Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/360b0c337f1b77da4ebb4cc2f20616ca.poster.avif?t=1743001892\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/360b0c337f1b77da4ebb4cc2f20616ca.webm?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/360b0c337f1b77da4ebb4cc2f20616ca.mp4?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Victor Shelby, a Los Angeles animal control officer abducted by aliens and stranded on a deadly dinosaur planet, where he must help a group of beautiful alien women survive. With over 7 hours of voice acting and performance capture, <i>Tamer: King of Dinosaurs</i> offers a gripping story filled with survival, base-building, and fully explicit romance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core  Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/e9e59db52ffb565527d0c8a71c72ff3f.poster.avif?t=1743001892\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/e9e59db52ffb565527d0c8a71c72ff3f.webm?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/e9e59db52ffb565527d0c8a71c72ff3f.mp4?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tamer: King of Dinosaurs</i></strong> is a one-time purchase, single-player survival game that blends action, fort building, and harem dating sim elements. Complete daily quests\u2014like fighting dinosaurs, gathering resources, and bonding with your lovers\u2014to build a fort and keep your tribe safe on a deadly alien world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explicit Romance and Love Making</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/7e4e1416f38c595fc33ad50ddc6f2aaa.poster.avif?t=1743001892\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/7e4e1416f38c595fc33ad50ddc6f2aaa.webm?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/7e4e1416f38c595fc33ad50ddc6f2aaa.mp4?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique women await you in Tamer: King of Dinosaurs. Each woman brings a different personality and specialty that can assist you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the novel series by New York Times Bestseller Michael-Scott Earle, Tamer: King of Dinosaurs blends action, survival, and a story-driven romance unlike any other adult (18+) game currently available. Our proprietary full-body performance capture technology is brought to life by a talented cast of professional actors, so every romance scene, every conflict, and every triumph is rooted in the context of our story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheela, the Huntress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/3df2ec056abb21d897afc975f37734f2.poster.avif?t=1743001892\" width=288 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/3df2ec056abb21d897afc975f37734f2.webm?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/3df2ec056abb21d897afc975f37734f2.mp4?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This stoic cat-like woman is skilled in combat and understands the dangers of this world. She\u2019ll join you on most of your quests, help you build weapons, and provide you with combat training. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galmine, the Gardener.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/8e8f167129f4fc76ca09344a69983204.poster.avif?t=1743001892\" width=288 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/8e8f167129f4fc76ca09344a69983204.webm?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/8e8f167129f4fc76ca09344a69983204.mp4?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This beautiful woman has the sweetest personality you could imagine, and she loves to grow her vegetables and herbs. She\u2019ll offer uplifting advice and provide you with recipes for food, poisons, and anything else plant related. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trel-Idil-Iria, Duchess of Family Iria, the Builder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/bbb13b0c2e6d228a35003e3dcd6c196c.poster.avif?t=1743001892\" width=288 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/bbb13b0c2e6d228a35003e3dcd6c196c.webm?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/bbb13b0c2e6d228a35003e3dcd6c196c.mp4?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trel is the most important, intelligent, and beautiful person in her world, and she\u2019ll remind you of this every chance she gets. Despite her haughty personality, she really is a genius. Once you win her over, she\u2019ll help you craft tools and build the fort. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kacerie, the Stylist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/73985fd10a034ac56bf79e59d38a03e5.poster.avif?t=1743001892\" width=288 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/73985fd10a034ac56bf79e59d38a03e5.webm?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/73985fd10a034ac56bf79e59d38a03e5.mp4?t=1743001892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pink haired and sassy, Kacerie comes from a world with slightly more advanced technology than our Earth. She doesn\u2019t want to be on this planet, but that\u2019s understandable. Once she forms a strong relationship with you, she\u2019ll be able to help you with all the cosmetic nuances of women\u2019s outfits and the new fort. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve earned enough respect with each woman, you will be able to make love to them. During the sex modules, you\u2019ll have complete control of the position, camera angle, lighting, and pace. Since Tamer: King of Dinosaurs is a harem game, you won\u2019t have to worry about picking just one love interest. All four women will fall in love with you as long as you complete the dating sim respect quests, and they do not have a problem sharing you with the others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are on track for a launch in 2025. Check out our website for more updates and don\u2019t forget to Wishlist!</p>",
